# Ozai, the Phoenix King: once Ozai leaves the battlefield, the mana it turned red stays only until the end of the current step or
# phase (the ruling; CR 106.4, 500.4). Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U} becomes {R}{R}{R} as the main phase ends; in the beginning of combat
# Bot2 exiles Ozai with Swords to Plowshares, the {R}{R}{R} is still there for the rest of that step, and it is lost as the step ends.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus x3
Ozai, the Phoenix King
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby#1.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus#1.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Ozai, the Phoenix King.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus#2.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ozai, the Phoenix King)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Exile.Count = 1
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

